    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to introduce 139 Fortunes Lawn, Citywest, Dublin to the market — a well‑appointed second‑floor, two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment located within a well‑maintained and highly sought‑after development.\r\n\r\nThe property opens into a warm and welcoming entrance hallway, complete with a large storage room and separate hot press. This leads to a bright, generously sized open‑plan kitchen, dining and living area. This superb space enjoys excellent natural light and provides direct access to a lovely westerly‑facing private balcony, perfect for evening relaxation or entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes two spacious double bedrooms, each fitted with built‑in wardrobes. The master bedroom features a well‑proportioned en‑suite bathroom with a window, while the apartment is further enhanced by a family bathroom, also benefiting from a window, ensuring natural ventilation and light throughout.\r\n\r\nThe property includes a designated parking space, offering secure and convenient parking for residents.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Citywest, the apartment is within walking distance of an excellent range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities at Citywest Shopping Centre. The LUAS Red Line is just a short stroll away, providing easy access to Dublin city centre. Citywest Business Campus, local parks, schools and childcare facilities are all nearby, while the N7 and M50 road networks are easily accessible, making this an attractive option for both owner‑occupiers and investors.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
